WEBVTT

00:09:26.890 --> 00:09:33.088
(Applause and cheers)

00:09:35.572 --> 00:09:36.831
Thank you.

00:09:36.855 --> 00:09:39.406
We forced them to change
their forfeiture practices

00:09:39.430 --> 00:09:41.659
and to compensate victims.

00:09:42.483 --> 00:09:46.785
(Applause and cheers)

00:09:47.640 --> 00:09:51.629
When our team first began
researching forfeiture in 2007,

00:09:51.653 --> 00:09:55.104
we had no idea how much
forfeiture revenue there was.

00:09:55.128 --> 00:09:56.507
In fact, no one knew.

00:09:57.182 --> 00:10:00.960
It wasn't until our groundbreaking study,
"Policing for Profit,"